type scene
version 1
---
# Holdout's arena, written by tools/make-assets.py (edit LAYOUT there and
# run it again): the floor, the canyon ring and its three gates, the cover
# (KayKit Space Base Bits, CC0) with a box collider each, the lamp posts,
# the skyline beyond the ring and the points src/world.ts reads by name.
# assets/nav/arena.ogt bakes the navmesh from it.
